318d59efeac50781d21d140ebcd932884c3bd924b1d10587eaaa","logical_entry_identity":"b7c1790fc4bc02e9713b3609cee33be6fe1292086f4e1e5de1aeb080fce49245","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s (Insane (Roguelike) difficulty)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s (疯狂难度（永久死亡模式）)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"51062afd7628efe3e92f7597f718dd2562e69303628bc0d0669098fb2ec2d0f2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea3ea109060864e0f6109678211fdbccc0bfd9237f01cc0748f899029fe1a400","logical_entry_identity":"a255947350837de0a87ae37f8bd19da3bed6f23ac7643d45032ed0cc00c7c223","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You prepare an additional trap (up to tier %d) with a special primed trigger that causes it to activate immediately when deployed. (Use this ability to select the trap.)\n\t\tNot all traps can be prepared this way and each trap can have only one type of preparation.\n\t\tKnown primable designs:\n%s\n\nA trap with a primed trigger gains %+d%% effectiveness (replacing the normal bonus from Trap Mastery) and won't break stealth %d%% of the time.\n#YELLOW#Current primed trap: %s#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你额外准备一个陷阱（最高材质等级 %d），带有特殊的控制机关，能在设置后立刻生效。（使用该技能来选择需要准备的陷阱。）\n\t\t并非所有陷阱都能这样准备，每种陷阱只有一种改进方式。\n\t\t已学会的引爆方式：\n%s\n\n带有特殊启动机关的陷阱强度增加 %+d%%（取代陷阱专精的加成），有 %d%% 几率不破坏潜行。\n#YELLOW#当前选择的陷阱：%s#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f9a8d6155283be050e0940d79f48772c00e6c109251a47f6867128a1bdd75ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea3ffbd05c3315da8e39aa499a2cdc8cc2a973dbc7030b51720262241a603fbb","logical_entry_identity":"902c94bc0a67d87911702516f96c3c597f00590abfa5dc55c727fe97a98444df","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I'm a very lucky girl, am I not... This is the second time I've had you to save me now.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我真是个幸运的女孩，不是吗……这是你第二次救我了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7f2e2af95c1dbbe2f67cc72780a6209a1f496935897d125599dd02bd59abab88","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea422fd96984e19137aa7cd47e3ba6e501ccb990b8078b8b05a679017af10a01","logical_entry_identity":"cf45b70efafa4b4b8a682f07c85661eea38f182a1e4f77e98978e8c407dbe0bd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shock Hands","source_tag":"talent name","target":"闪电之触"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be97adf9d2fe21ffe9fa2df95279395139c4edded4a4a745a6854dfdd7dcb5cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea460b946d176ff31f9778ac18eeb073d3f7a05fe467c4cbfc70adc811060237","logical_entry_identity":"2120b32921bd290926fadec03a69299a95ec84aaf14e8a8ed65508efa73d2914","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Maybe I'll visit him. Thank you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"也许我会见见他，谢谢。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a1aa46ee722f74cb483271d39df23c8d332568185d09aa12de6808b293d30a87","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea4c9e1c8864a99ca4cc2ed45bc09fae542786feef2058485672125a1d8089da","logical_entry_identity":"5006a1ff8f021c3df0a92173d842c9a8b28110dba95e6b07a4f28cbe24e75609","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This rod is made entirely of voratun, infused with raw magical energies that can bend space itself.\nYou have heard of such items before. They are very useful to adventurers, allowing faster travel.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个法杖通体用沃瑞钽打造，充满了可以撕裂空间的奥术能量。你以前曾听说过此类物品。它们对于冒险者的快速旅行非常有帮助。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5bdba8f58b06f294b00d65504e1e9eb179c5d5976e80b509c57452460385f002","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ea4e693b3bda8a455daf2cd7ed829f6d80bda6635e41b9c510ebd7d8db3276aa","logical_entry_identity":"7160d86ea3d18b899dc642dd0d1063455ee4f59ea3e6996f24bcf07268b48aae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Open a dark portal (radius 3) to the target zone. All creatures caught inside will be teleported to your location, and you to theirs.\n\t\tAll creatures (except you) traversing the portal will catch a random disease, doing %0.2f blight damage per turn for 6 turns and reducing one of its physical stats (strength, constitution, dexterity) by %d.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在目标区域开启一道半径 3 的黑暗传送门。区域内所有生物都会被传送到你的位置附近，而你则被传送到目标地点。\n\t\t穿过传送门的所有生物（除你外）都会感染一种随机疾病，在 6 回合内每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害，并使其一项物理属性（力量、体质或敏捷）降低 %d 点。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}